silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_06_circuit_imprint_transport_sections_03_circuit_7_metaprogramming_substrate_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'Circuit7MetaprogrammingSubstrateYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the transported patient image is available to clinic metaprograms; also, the functor F sends Mittens to F(Mittens), giving the central object of the transport diagram its clinic-side image." .
